{"3028550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Moment", "steam_appid": 3028550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>Lost Moment is a short walking simulator where you need to find anomalies.</strong><br><br>You wake up again in the middle of the night in your apartment. There’s still time to get some more sleep, but a glass of water before bed wouldn’t hurt. You head to the kitchen and... A knock at the door.<br><br>The whole game takes place in an apartment.<br>Your task is to search for anomalies.<br>You will wake up every hour and check: Has anything changed in your apartment? Has something appeared? Or someone?<br>If something is wrong, you need to exit through the front door.<br>If everything is fine, go back to sleep.<br><br>For the correct choice, time will move forward.<br>For the wrong one, you will be reset to the beginning.<br><br>The game features many unique anomalies that are noticeable.<br>You don’t need to search for them with a magnifying glass.<br><br>You need to last until 7 AM.<br>At least, that’s what you were promised.<br><br><strong>Good night.</strong><br><br><strong>Play Time</strong><br>30-120 min.<br><br><strong>A message from the developer:</strong><br>I made this game alone.<br>The translation into some languages may be inaccurate. If you notice an error, please report it in my Discord channel.<br><br>In the notes, I’ve placed my thoughts that trouble me.<br><br><strong>Thank you in advance for playing :)</strong>", "about_the_game": "<strong>Lost Moment is a short walking simulator where you need to find anomalies.</strong><br><br>You wake up again in the middle of the night in your apartment. There’s still time to get some more sleep, but a glass of water before bed wouldn’t hurt. You head to the kitchen and... A knock at the door.<br><br>The whole game takes place in an apartment.<br>Your task is to search for anomalies.<br>You will wake up every hour and check: Has anything changed in your apartment? Has something appeared? Or someone?<br>If something is wrong, you need to exit through the front door.<br>If everything is fine, go back to sleep.<br><br>For the correct choice, time will move forward.<br>For the wrong one, you will be reset to the beginning.<br><br>The game features many unique anomalies that are noticeable.<br>You don’t need to search for them with a magnifying glass.<br><br>You need to last until 7 AM.<br>At least, that’s what you were promised.<br><br><strong>Good night.</strong><br><br><strong>Play Time</strong><br>30-120 min.<br><br><strong>A message from the developer:</strong><br>I made this game alone.<br>The translation into some languages may be inaccurate. If you notice an error, please report it in my Discord channel.<br><br>In the notes, I’ve placed my thoughts that trouble me.<br><br><strong>Thank you in advance for playing :)</strong>", "short_description": "Look for various anomalies happening in your apartment. If you do everything correctly — time will move forward. If not — you will return. Good night.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028550/header.jpg?t=1721030918", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1721030918", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1721030918", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1.01 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong